            "value" : "Add Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填你自己的 Key，费用直接走你的账号，语阅不经手。读过的句子存在这台 Mac 上，再听不花钱，断网也能听；听书时会把这一章提前合成好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use your own key; costs go straight to your account and Yuyue never handles them. Sentences once read are kept on this Mac, so hearing them again is free and works offline. While you listen, the rest of the chapter is fetched ahead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填你自己的 Key，费用直接走你的账号，语阅不经手。读过的句子存在这台设备上，再听不花钱，断网也能听；听书时会把这一章提前合成好。" : {
