    "纸色换成墨水屏那种带颗粒的浅灰，字是纯黑；划线变成黑色的实线、波浪线；封面、插图转成灰度；没有任何动画，翻页是整页直接切换，界面也不再有阴影和毛玻璃。关掉后回到原来的纸色。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The paper turns a grainy e-ink grey and text pure black; highlights become black solid or wavy lines; covers and pictures turn greyscale; there are no animations, pages switch at once, and the interface drops shadows and blur. Turn it off to get your paper color back."
